  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into fries and place on the lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt.\n• Toss to coat, spread out evenly and bake until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61d7f8e94380961fb417d9c0/step-d0615001.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice tomato. Slice the haloumi horizontally to get 1 piece per person.\n• In a shallow bowl, add classic roast seasoning. In a second shallow bowl, whisk egg. In a third shallow bowl, place panko breadcrumbs (see ingredients).\n• Dip haloumi into seasoning, followed by egg and finally in panko breadcrumbs. Set aside on a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61d7f8e94380961fb417d9c0/step-58fdbfb6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with enough oil to coat the base of pan.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 2 mins each side. Set aside on a plate lined with paper towel.\n• Meanwhile, bake burger buns directly on oven rack until heated through, 2-3 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61d7f8e94380961fb417d9c0/step-e03658dd.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Halve buns and spread with 1/2 the mayonnaise and 1/2 the sweet chilli sauce. Top with baby spinach leaves, tomato and haloumi.\n• In a small bowl, combine remaining mayo and sweet chilli sauce.\n• Serve with fries and sweet chilli mayo.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61d7f8e94380961fb417d9c0/step-16bc8302.jpg"
    }
  ]
